OL,3,GNEWSAStudents vote to retain university
OL,4,Acampus' historic name
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents have voted to continue using
OL,7,Fthe traditional name of Ulster
OL,8,FUniversity's campus in Londonderry
OL,9,Fdespite it being rebranded in 2023.
OL,11,FMore than 3,000 students said they
OL,12,Fwanted to continue to refer to the
OL,13,FDerry campus as Magee in an Ulster
OL,14,FUniversity Student Union (UUSU)
OL,15,Freferendum.
OL,17,FThe vote means UUSU will continue to
OL,18,Fuse Magee, which was named after its
OL,19,F19th Century benefactor, in its
OL,20,Fcorrespondence, materials and branding.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
