OL,3,GNEWSAStudents vote to retain university
OL,4,Acampus' historic name
OL,5,
OL,6,FUlster University rebranded the campus
OL,7,Fas "Derry~Londonderry" in 2023, amid
OL,8,Fcriticism it had not consulted with
OL,9,Fstaff or the local community.
